UPDATE catalog_products SET definition = 'E-Safe Fibre Glass Electrical earthing discharge rods are specialised safety devices used to safely remove residual electrical charges from disconnected high-voltage circuits and equipment before maintenance, ensuring protection from electrical shock and arc flash hazards.
