UPDATE catalog_products SET definition = 'E-Safe FRP work benches are robust work surfaces constructed from Fiber Reinforced Plastic (FRP), designed to offer high chemical and corrosion resistance, electrical insulation, and strength for industrial, laboratory, and outdoor settings.
