UPDATE catalog_products SET definition = 'E-Safe High Voltage Non Contact Sensor is a safety device designed to Detect any AC voltage and Induced voltage presence on live conductor, overhead Power lines in HV and EHV switch yards, Distribution lines, Transmission Lines, Industries and Power plants. 
